+++   docker compose --env-file .env.staging -f docker-compose.staging.yml -p vita_staging down
+++   ```
+++2. Matar o processo de monitoramento:
+++   ```bash
+++   kill $MONITOR_PID 2>/dev/null || true
+++   ```
